# Optional shared secret matched against the backend's AUDIT_FRONTEND_TOKEN.
# Sent as the X-Audit-Token header on every call to airbnb-audit-rho.vercel.app.
# Bundled into the JS at build time, so this is a rotatable speed bump rather
# than real auth. Leave unset for local dev unless the backend has the gate on.
VITE_AUDIT_TOKEN=
